    setup: {
      players: 'Mauscheln is played by 3 to 5 players. A 32-card German-suited pack is standard; with more players a 52-card French pack may be used. Each player receives 4 cards (dealt 2+2); one card is turned for trump and the remainder form the talon.',
      deck: '32 cards. Ranking: Ace (High), King, Queen/Over, Jack/Under, 10, 9, 8, 7.',
      equipment: 'Cards; chips or coins for the pot (Pinke).',
      dealing: 'Dealer places a fixed stake (e.g., 4 coins) in the pot (Pinke). Each player gets 4 cards (2+2). A trump card is turned up.',
